vigo-browser (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Phase 5: Security & Installer build.
  * Built-in ad/tracker blocking with Rust engine.
  * Universal media playback (HEVC, AV1, VP9, AAC, FLAC, Opus).
  * Hardware-accelerated video decode (VAAPI).
  * End-to-end encrypted sync.
  * Credential vault.
  * Privacy engine with anti-fingerprinting.

 -- Vigo Browser Team <team@vigobrowser.com>  Mon, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
